    {
      "excerpt": "银屑病面积和严重程度指数（PASI）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "研究期间的检查和评估",
        "疗效评价"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p820"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 25860,
      "source_ref": "body.p820",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p820"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-4b8b1f21ec3afc8b3f90fede",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "PASI评分是综合皮损严重程度（包括红斑、厚度、鳞屑）及皮损面积对银屑病严重程度进行定量评价^[9]。PASI评分在0-72分之间，分数越高表示程度越严重。评分细则见附录4。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "研究期间的检查和评估",
        "疗效评价"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p821"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 25870,
      "source_ref": "body.p821",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p821"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-f17962eb229797524736e432",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "医生整体评估（PGA）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "研究期间的检查和评估",
        "疗效评价"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p822"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 25880,
      "source_ref": "body.p822",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p822"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-4a56866bbf64df4acb399ba8",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "PGA是根据患者红斑、鳞屑和斑块厚度整体情况进行评分^[10]。PGA评分在0-4分之间，分数越高表示程度越严重。评分细则见附录5。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "研究期间的检查和评估",
        "疗效评价"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p823"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 25890,
      "source_ref": "body.p823",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p823"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-5433d768c6df4a1c7531ee50",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "受累的体表面积（BSA）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "研究期间的检查和评估",
        "疗效评价"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p824"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 25900,
      "source_ref": "body.p824",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p824"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-2500e2723112e896345c33ab",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "BSA是将患者单个手掌及手指屈侧面积定义为人体表面积的1%^[11]，评估患者全身皮损总和达到多少个手掌面积，记为BSA。参与者BSA评分在0%-100%之间，分数越大表示皮损面积越大。评分细则见“疗效评价SOP”文件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "研究期间的检查和评估",
        "疗效评价"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p825"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
