      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 25920,
      "source_ref": "body.p826",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p826"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-c984573a961144b7ecb4f8df",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "DLQI是一份包含10个问题的问卷，用于评估上1周内患者主观感受因疾病对生活质量所造成的影响^[12]。DLQI评分在0-30分之间，分数越高表示生活质量受损越严重。DLQI评分细则见附录6。",
      "heading_path": [
